<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <title>Payment Confirmation - [Your Company Name]</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>Hello {{customer.name}},</p>

    <p>We are pleased to inform you that the payment for your project with [Your
      Company Name] has been successfully made. Thank you for your prompt
      payment and trust in our services.</p>

    <p>Below are the details of your project:</p>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>Project Name:</strong> {{project.name}}</li>
      <li><strong>Project ID:</strong> {{project.id}}</li>
    </ul>

    <p><strong>Payment Details:</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Payment Status:</strong> Paid in Full</li>
      <li><strong>Payment Amount:</strong> {{payment.amount}}</li>
      <li><strong>Payment Date:</strong> {{payment.date}}</li>
    </ul>

    <p>We appreciate your timely cooperation, and we are excited to continue
      working on your project. If you have any further questions or require
      additional assistance, please don't hesitate to contact our team.</p>

    <p>Thank you for choosing [Your Company Name]. We look forward to delivering
      a successful project for you!</p>

    <p>Best regards,
      <br />
      {{company_name}}
    </p>
  </body>
</html>